msgid "`allowed_consumers` MUST contain explicit client `application_id` values. Discovery MUST require the provider to allow the consumer and the consumer to support the provider's transport and authentication scheme. Authorized but unrenderable entries MUST fail reconciliation with a machine-readable reason; they MUST NOT disappear silently."
